      "date": "2026-04-22T17:03:12.000Z",
      "title": "HINDPETRO: New Energy Collaborations Will Support Long Term Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have adjusted their fair value estimate for Hindustan Petroleum slightly lower from about ₹683.63 to ₹679.86, reflecting updated views on revenue growth, profit margins and the P/E multiple they apply to future earnings. What's in the News Indian Gas Exchange and Hindustan Petroleum signed an MoU at India Energy Week 2026 in Goa to improve access to regasification infrastructure and support market based participation in India's natural gas ecosystem (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/energy/nse-hindpetro/hindustan-petroleum-shares/cqrpcan2-urbanization-and-digital-advances-will-drive-energy-transformation-krbe/updates/4-analysts-have-adjusted-their-fair-value-estimate-for-hindust",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
      "id": "1773daca-e582-4c12-b856-0db4cfc24424",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-09T11:41:57.000Z",
      "title": "Price target decreased by 7.0% to ₹444",
      "body": "Down from ₹477, the current price target is an average from 31 analysts. New target price is 24% above last closing price of ₹358. Stock is down 5.6% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹72.96 for next year compared to ₹31.66 last year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "142fc73c-d5a2-4d95-bbe7-6d29eecec315",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-04-06T06:03:43.000Z",
      "title": "HINDPETRO: New Energy MoUs Will Sustain Elevated P E Risk",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their fair value estimate for Hindustan Petroleum from about ₹357.82 to roughly ₹240.25. This reflects updated assumptions around the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E expectations.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/energy/nse-hindpetro/hindustan-petroleum-shares/d14znalp-indias-clean-mobility-shift-will-crush-traditional-fuel-revenues-1z8p/updates/6-analysts-have-trimmed-their-fair-value-estimate-for-hindusta",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
